I am in the office.
It is Friday and very quiet here.
I am working on my laptop.
My colleague Jonas sits opposite me.
The large window is right next to us.
We look outside.
The sky is dark grey.
It is still raining heavily.
"It is really wet and cold today," I say.
Jonas nods and types on his laptop.
He reads the news on the internet.
He checks the weather forecast.
Suddenly he smiles.
"I have good news, Maya," Jonas says.
"The weather will get better in the afternoon."
"It will not rain anymore," he explains.
"The clouds will disappear and it will be sunny."
I look back at the grey rain.
That is a fantastic forecast.
